<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view class="grow">
        <view class="f-title">我的邀请码</view>
        <view class="muted">发给朋友，对方在下面输入就能加你</view>
      </view>
      <view class="code" bindtap="copyCode">{{inviteCode || '—'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="row" style="gap:16rpx;margin-top:20rpx">
      <input class="field-input grow" style="background:#f0f0f3;border-radius:20rpx;padding:0 24rpx;height:80rpx"
             value="{{target}}" placeholder="对方的用户名或邀请码" bindinput="onTarget" />
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-mini" style="height:80rpx" bindtap="add">添加</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">好友（{{friends.length}}）</view>
  <view class="card card-tight" wx:if="{{friends.length}}">
    <view class="list-item row-between" wx:for="{{friends}}" wx:key="username"
          data-u="{{item.username}}" bindtap="openHome" bindlongpress="remove">
      <view class="row grow">
        <view class="avatar-sm">{{item.initial}}</view>
        <view class="grow" style="margin-left:20rpx">
          <view class="f-title ellipsis">{{item.nickname || item.username}}</view>
          <view class="muted ellipsis">{{item.username}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="chev">›</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card empty" wx:else>还没有好友。加上好友后，就能看到对方设为「仅好友」的动态 / 行程 / 打卡。</view>
  <view class="hint">点进好友主页可看对方的动态、打卡、评价、行程；长按可删好友。</view>
</view>
